  75:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/event_groups.c ****  * wait condition is met if any of the bits set in uxBitsToWait for are also set
  76:middleware/FreeRTOS-Kernel/event_groups.c ****  * in uxCurrentEventBits.
